    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), right after an enemy unit picks its targets. Pick a **TYRANIDS MONSTER** unit of yours that is a target of at least 1 of those attacks.\n\nThe enemy unit takes a [Battle-shock](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock) test. For the rest of the phase, its models' attacks against your unit get -1 to their **[Hit rolls](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls)**, and also -1 to their **[Wound rolls](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls)** if it failed that test.",
